### 4. Re-fetch reproducibly

Save that id, and `dg_refetch()` gets back the exact same table later — no
matter how titles or file names drift on the platform:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
again <- dg_refetch(tbl)
identical(again, tbl)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] TRUE
```


